---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Site active="services">
  <section class="hero-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr); align-items: stretch; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: linear-gradient(rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.09), rgb(255, 255, 255));">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(46px, 6vw, 86px) 24px;">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 860px;">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">For Maryland Self-Directed Services families</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(33px, 4.3vw, 48px); line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.036em; color: var(--clairo-navy); max-width: 18ch;">Keep what you value about self-direction.</h1>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 18.5px; line-height: 29px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--clairo-blue); max-width: 48ch;">And understand what other options may be available to you.</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 54ch;">Self-direction gave your family real choice — over caregivers, wages, scheduling, and how services are delivered. Clairo Care is a provider agency built to support those same values, not to talk you out of them.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
          <a href="#paths"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">See the three paths</Button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 740px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Start with what worked</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Self-direction gave families things worth protecting.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 64ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Clairo is not anti-SDS. Families chose self-direction for real reasons, and any conversation about options should start by naming them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Choice</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Deciding who provides support, not being assigned someone.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Caregiver control</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Building a team of people the participant already knows and trusts.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Wage flexibility</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Influence over what caregivers are paid within the budget.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Scheduling flexibility</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Support that fits the participant's actual week.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Involvement in services</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">A real say in how services are designed and delivered.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 2px;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Family and friends</p><p style="margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">The ability, where permitted, to employ people close to the participant.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--clairo-navy); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="max-width: 780px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">What families are asking about now</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.14; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The questions we hear most from self-directing families.</h2>
        <p style="margin: 17px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 66ch;">We can't predict how Maryland's rules will evolve. What we can do is be transparent about how Clairo works so families can weigh their options with real information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Caregiver wages</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Whether the wages that keep a trusted caregiver in the role can be sustained going forward.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The 60/40 framework</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">What the split means in practice for a participant’s budget and care team.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Evolving rules</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Changes to budget methodology and requirements that are still taking shape.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Administrative burden</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Employer responsibilities, timekeeping, payroll, and paperwork sitting with the family.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Keeping caregivers</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Whether the people the participant depends on can stay in the role.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Uncertainty ahead</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Planning a care team when the next set of changes is not yet known.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="paths" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 740px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Three conceptual paths</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">None of these is universally better.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 64ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Which path makes sense depends entirely on the participant's plan, authorizations, services, caregivers, and priorities. Here is how each one tends to work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <article class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Path one</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Remain fully self-directed</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">You keep the employer role and continue directing all services as you do today. For many families this is the right answer, and nothing here suggests otherwise.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">You keep full control of the employer budget</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Administrative responsibilities stay with the family</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">No change to your current care team</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Path two</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Move selected applicable services to Clairo</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Depending on the plan and authorizations, some services may be delivered by Clairo while other applicable services remain self-directed.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Clairo employs caregivers only for services it delivers</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Other services can stay in self-direction</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Administration for Clairo-delivered services moves to us</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="clairo-card" style="padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Path three</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Potentially transition more services to Clairo</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Some families eventually prefer to have more of their services delivered by a provider agency and step back from employer responsibilities.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Clairo carries payroll, compliance, and provider duties</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Families stay involved in building the care team</span></div>
            <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Can be approached gradually, service by service</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="clairo-card" style="margin-top: 22px; padding: 24px 26px; background: var(--background); display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;">
        <span style="width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.12); color: var(--clairo-blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"></path></svg></span>
        <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 96ch;">Every participant's plan, authorizations, services, and circumstances are different. Whether any service can move to a provider agency — and what happens to the rest — depends on DDA requirements and the individual plan. Clairo is funded as a provider agency for the services Clairo delivers and does not control a participant's self-directed employer budget. Nothing on this page is regulatory guidance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="wages" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px);">
      <div style="background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 54px); position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="position: absolute; right: -68px; top: -70px; width: 230px; height: 230px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(92, 182, 242, 0.09);"></div>
        <div style="position: relative;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">More for the people providing care</p>
          <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.6vw, 40px); line-height: 1.13; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 22ch;">What Clairo pays caregivers.</h2>
          <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 69ch;">Our low-overhead model is designed to put more of the available service funding into caregiver compensation for the services Clairo delivers.</p>
          <div class="four-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 34px;">
            <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.19); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 23px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); min-height: 158px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Personal Supports</p>
              <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">$32.50<span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">–$35.50/hr</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.19); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 23px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); min-height: 158px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Community Development</p>
              <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">$40+<span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">/hr possible*</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.19); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 23px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); min-height: 158px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Mileage</p>
              <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Reimbursed</p>
            </div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.19); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 23px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); min-height: 158px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Eligible caregivers</p>
              <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Health + PTO</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/wages-and-benefits"><Button>See full wages &amp; benefits →</Button></a>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 18px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 66ch;">*CDS wages depend on the funding allocated to that service. Clairo cannot guarantee any particular wage, and wages vary by service, participant circumstances, available funding, and employee eligibility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 760px); gap: 48px; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Your care team</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">The people you found stay the people you keep.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body">The hardest part of self-direction to replace isn't the paperwork — it's the caregivers you spent years finding. For services Clairo delivers, those caregivers can often apply to work through us.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; margin-top: 22px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Current SDS caregivers can apply to become Clairo employees</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Qualified family and friends may be eligible where DDA rules permit</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Participants stay involved in decisions about their care team</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Clairo takes on employment, payroll, training, and compliance</span></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/how-it-works" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">See what a transition involves →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px) 24px 30px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
